WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.434
-Hey, guys, it is time
for a brand-new game.

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:04.934
This is "Shreddy or Not."

00:00:04.934 --> 00:00:06.968
-♪ Shreddy or not, shreddy
or not, shreddy or not ♪

00:00:06.968 --> 00:00:09.601
♪ Shreddy or not, yeah ♪

00:00:09.601 --> 00:00:11.667
-Now, here's how this works.

00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:14.200
Before the show, we found
two members from our audience

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.868
to come join us
down here on stage.

00:00:15.868 --> 00:00:19.367
One of them is really good
at guitar, a shredder.

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:22.467
The other has never held
a guitar before in their life.

00:00:22.467 --> 00:00:24.033
We have to figure out who's who

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:25.501
by asking them
each one question.

00:00:25.501 --> 00:00:27.667
Can we get our guitarists
to the stage, please?

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:29.200
Come on over.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.067
-♪ Shreddy or not, shreddy or
not, shreddy or not, yeah ♪

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:35.968
-I'm just kidding.
How you doing?

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:37.434
Nice to see you, bud.

00:00:37.434 --> 00:00:38.834
Thank you for being here.

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:40.567
Okay, contestant number one,

00:00:40.567 --> 00:00:42.067
what is your name,
and where are you from?

00:00:42.067 --> 00:00:43.667
-My name is Ellis,
and I'm from L.A.

00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:46.968
-Okay. Ellis from L.A.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:46.968 --> 00:00:48.133
Contestant number two,

00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:49.400
what is your name,
and where are you from?

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.901
-My name is Hector.
And I'm originally from

00:00:50.901 --> 00:00:52.267
New York,
but I live in Jersey now.

00:00:52.267 --> 00:00:54.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:54.667 --> 00:00:56.434
-And that's all I can ask you.

00:00:56.434 --> 00:00:57.868
That's all I can ask you.

00:00:57.868 --> 00:01:00.400
Now we have to figure out
if you can shred.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.534
Quest, you go first.

00:01:01.534 --> 00:01:03.167
You can ask them both
just one question.

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:05.534
For both of them.
-Okay.

00:01:05.534 --> 00:01:12.767
Did you master "Eruption"
or "Stairway to Heaven" first?

00:01:12.767 --> 00:01:15.367
-"Eruption."

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:17.067
-I have no idea what that is.

00:01:17.067 --> 00:01:24.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.334 --> 00:01:25.400
-That's interesting.

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:27.968
I feel like that's
a very poker move.

00:01:27.968 --> 00:01:29.033
It's gotta be.

00:01:29.033 --> 00:01:30.234
-He's trying to throw you
off the trail.

00:01:30.234 --> 00:01:31.901
-Yeah, he's trying to throw me
off the trail.

00:01:31.901 --> 00:01:34.334
Higgins, it's your turn.
What's your question?

00:01:34.334 --> 00:01:37.300
-Well, Quest took mine.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:42.634
But mullet. You have a mullet.
Hmm.

00:01:42.634 --> 00:01:45.901
Alright. Is one of your fingers
super callused?

00:01:45.901 --> 00:01:47.901
-I mean, I use my hands a lot,

00:01:47.901 --> 00:01:50.467
so I have many calluses
on a lot of my fingers.

00:01:50.467 --> 00:01:51.968
-Hmm.
-Okay.

00:01:51.968 --> 00:01:53.234
-Okay.
-Alright.

00:01:53.234 --> 00:01:57.801
How about you?
-They're kind of soft, so...

00:01:57.801 --> 00:01:59.400
No, not really. They're soft.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:02.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.467 --> 00:02:05.033
-Bonus question.
Can you play "Wonderwall"?

00:02:05.033 --> 00:02:07.133
-Of course. Who can't play
"Wonderwall," you know?

00:02:07.133 --> 00:02:08.868
-I thought he would say,
"maybaaay."

00:02:08.868 --> 00:02:10.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:11.267
-Alright.
Higgins, you asked too many.

00:02:11.267 --> 00:02:14.267
Alright.

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:16.868
Okay, I think I know who shreds
and who doesn't,

00:02:16.868 --> 00:02:21.367
but my question is

00:02:21.367 --> 00:02:26.534
there's a lady who's sure
all that glitters is gold.

00:02:26.534 --> 00:02:27.767
-What is that?

00:02:27.767 --> 00:02:30.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.667 --> 00:02:34.100
-I'm sure she's
a wonderful lady.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:37.167
-Ah!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.167 --> 00:02:39.934
-Alright.
It's time to make our guesses.

00:02:39.934 --> 00:02:42.133
Quest, who is the shredder?
What do you think?

00:02:42.133 --> 00:02:44.133
Contestant number one
or contestant number two?

00:02:44.133 --> 00:02:46.534
-Contestant number two is
trying to throw me off.

00:02:46.534 --> 00:02:48.200
I think it's contestant
number two.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:49.534
-Okay.
Higgbones, what do you think?

00:02:49.534 --> 00:02:50.868
-I'm going to go with Quest.

00:02:50.868 --> 00:02:55.868
'Cause it's too --
it's too, too much.

00:02:55.868 --> 00:02:58.267
[ Laughter ]
-I don't know.

00:02:58.267 --> 00:03:00.701
I will say contestant number one
is kind of holding it

00:03:00.701 --> 00:03:02.367
like he's ready to just explode
on the world.

00:03:02.367 --> 00:03:05.868
-Right. Ready to rock, yeah.
-And so I feel --

00:03:05.868 --> 00:03:08.000
But unless he's doing
a really good poker --

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:09.601
-I think he is. I think he is.

00:03:09.601 --> 00:03:11.767
He's like Maverick. Not the
movie, but the poker player.

00:03:11.767 --> 00:03:12.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.968 --> 00:03:14.167
-Alright. It's time to find out.

00:03:14.167 --> 00:03:16.367
Contestant number one,
show us what you got.

00:03:16.367 --> 00:03:18.000
Roots, can we get a beat
and see?

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:25.133
♪♪

00:03:25.133 --> 00:03:32.234
♪♪

00:03:32.234 --> 00:03:39.367
♪♪

00:03:39.367 --> 00:03:40.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:40.901 --> 00:03:42.367
We got played.

00:03:42.367 --> 00:03:44.200
I think we got played
pretty bad.

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:46.267
Contestant number two.
Let's see if shreddy or not.

00:03:46.267 --> 00:03:53.834
♪♪

00:03:53.834 --> 00:04:01.467
♪♪

00:04:01.467 --> 00:04:03.367
Oh, my God!

00:04:03.367 --> 00:04:07.868
♪♪

00:04:07.868 --> 00:04:10.601
Oh!

00:04:10.601 --> 00:04:12.367
That's what I'm talking about
right there.

00:04:12.367 --> 00:04:14.033
Contestant number two,
you are the winner.

00:04:14.033 --> 00:04:16.334
Congratulations.

00:04:16.334 --> 00:04:19.601
You get a year subscription

00:04:19.601 --> 00:04:21.534
to "RV Lifestyle" magazine

00:04:21.534 --> 00:04:23.167
because you're going to be
going on tour.

00:04:23.167 --> 00:04:24.334
-That's right.

00:04:24.334 --> 00:04:25.968
-And both of you --
Here, you can take it.

00:04:25.968 --> 00:04:28.400
You both are going home
with custom

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:30.868
Shreddy Vedder sweatshirts
tonight.

00:04:30.868 --> 00:04:34.300
♪♪

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:36.200
Congratulations.
Thank you for playing.

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:37.901
You shred, buddy.
That was awesome.

00:04:37.901 --> 00:04:39.133
Oh, my God. Thanks for playing.

